From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jianfeng Liu <liujianfeng1994@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 21:03:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] armsom-sige6: add ArmSoM Sige6 device tree

Add the ArmSoM Sige6 device tree to the vendor kernel.

Device tree adapted from ArmSoM T527_AIOT_V1.4.8 SDK board.dts (linux-5.15).
Board-level differences from Orange Pi 4 Pro: LPDDR5 DRAM, AC101B audio,
PE6/PE7 LEDs, PK7/PK8 USB VBUS regulators, pwm-fan on J6.

---
