+	 * @hdmi_cec_enable: control cec function
+	 *	- 1: enable cec function
+	 *	- 0: disable cec function
+	 * @hdmi_clock_source: select hdmi pixel clock source
+	 *	- 1: from ccmu clock
+	 *	- 0: from phypll clock
